			"notes": "# GCA Sinytra Connector Compat Plugin\n\nThis release provides compatibility plugins for running Gugle Carpet Addition (GCA) through Sinytra Connector on NeoForge. Two independent files are available:\n\n- `gca-compat-neoforge-sinytra-mc1.21.1-1.0.0.jar`\n- `gca-compat-neoforge-sinytra-mc26.1.2-1.0.0.jar`\n\nThese plugins only patch version-specific incompatibilities encountered while Connector transforms GCA. They do not include GCA, Carpet, Sinytra Connector, or Forgified Fabric API.\n\n> [!WARNING]\n> Carpet for Minecraft 26.1.2 does not currently support Sinytra Connector. Installing the 26.1.2 Compat Plugin does not guarantee that GCA and Carpet will start successfully on NeoForge 26.1.2. This file is provided for future compatibility work and testing. Please wait for the required support from Carpet or Connector before using this setup in a regular game instance.\n\n## Minecraft 1.21.1\n\nThe legacy Connector version used on Minecraft 1.21.1 does not provide the `TransformerPlugin` registration API. This compatibility plugin prepares GCA before Connector scans it, then lets Connector perform its normal transformation process.\n\nThe patched copy is stored under `.cache/gca/{version}/` in the game directory. The installed GCA mod file is never modified.\n\n## Minecraft 26.1.2\n\nThe 26.1.2 plugin uses the `TransformerPlugin` API provided by Connector 3.x. It cannot resolve the separate issue that Carpet itself does not yet support Sinytra Connector on Minecraft 26.1.2.\n\n## Installation\n\n### Minecraft 1.21.1\n\nPlace all of the following files in the `mods` directory of the same NeoForge instance:\n\n1. The GCA mod.\n2. `gca-compat-neoforge-sinytra-mc1.21.1-1.0.0.jar`.\n3. A Sinytra Connector build for Minecraft 1.21.1.\n4. A Forgified Fabric API build for Minecraft 1.21.1.\n5. Fabric Carpet and its required dependencies.\n\nOn startup, the compatibility plugin locates GCA 1.21.1 and creates the patched input used by Connector. Do not install both versions of the Compat Plugin in the same instance.\n\n### Minecraft 26.1.2\n\nUse `gca-compat-neoforge-sinytra-mc26.1.2-1.0.0.jar` together with the corresponding GCA mod, Connector, Forgified Fabric API, and Carpet files.\n\nBecause Carpet 26.1.2 does not currently support Sinytra Connector, this setup is intended only for compatibility development and testing. It is not recommended for regular gameplay yet.\n\n## Notes\n\n- The Compat Plugin is only required for NeoForge with Sinytra Connector. Do not install it on Fabric or Quilt.\n- Install only the Compat Plugin matching the Minecraft version of the instance.\n- The Compat Plugin must be installed alongside the GCA mod. It does not replace GCA itself.\n- Updating GCA creates a new cache entry based on the GCA version and patched content. The GCA mod does not need to be modified manually.\n- Recheck compatibility and review the startup log after updating NeoForge, Connector, Carpet, or GCA."
		},
